  "2026-08-27T05:00:29.485Z","harness:codex","TDD red: review regression run failed lifecycle alias positional metadata (install returned undefined), nested upgrade scope aliases (project/local/global absent), and upgrade intent summaries (generic Run package upgrade). The combined focused command reported 7 expected failures and 216 passes."
  "2026-08-27T05:22:43.998Z","harness:codex","Review closure evidence: implemented package lifecycle alias positional parity, nested project/local/global scope parity, specific install/upgrade operation intents, safe wildcard documentation, and regenerated full SDK contract fixtures. Focused linked suites passed 418/418; full lint/static quality passed; repository coverage passed 8,037/8,037 tests across 585 files at exact 100/100/100/100 (59,704 statements, 44,940 branches, 12,419 functions, 57,492 lines); typecheck, dependency audit, secret scan, and docs-links gate passed. Fresh temp acceptance at /tmp/pm-cli-review-e2e-Cgqkrk confirmed install/upgrade targets and specific intents from built CLI contracts."
