  "2026-08-27T06:47:18.052Z","harness:codex","Exact-head evidence: aggregate package aliases are now only extension/packages while package install alone owns install; extension/package shell completion action sets include migrate. Focused contract/completion/SDK linked plan passed 5/5 commands and 578 assertions. Full repository proof passed 585 files, 8,038 tests, exact 100/100/100/100 coverage, lint/static/type/security/docs gates, and fresh temp acceptance across bash/zsh/fish plus runtime contract JSON."
